# The game's smoke test: nnh run <game> --pc --script tests/smoke.nnhs (the simulator), or without --pc on the
# console (Homebrew Launcher open, press Y). Grow it with your game. Script format: the NNHGE guide
# "Testing on the console" (guides/testing-on-the-console.md).
# Each expect waits for a line the script's own input causes: lines the game logs before the script is attached
# (like "play: started") come too early to be expected.

fail-on "] E "                  # any error line fails the script
wait 30                         # let the game settle
tap SELECT
expect "play: running" 10       # the scene answers SELECT: it started and runs
wait 10                         # input right after a log line may reach the console late: wait a little
tap A
expect "play: blip" 10          # A plays the sound
wait 10
stick circle 1 0                # push the Circle Pad right ...
wait 30                         # ... for half a second
stick circle 0 0
expect "play: stopped at (" 30  # the sprite moved and came to rest
wait 10
screenshot moved
tap START
expect "play: quit" 10          # START quits (the game ends after 30 frames of "Bye!")
end
